# Written by this extension's own "Connect Claude Code" / "Connect Codex" when
# they are used on this repository, and both carry the workspace's MCP bearer
# token. Upstream's design is that a project commits these and shares them with
# a team; that is fine for a *consumer's* project and wrong here, because this
# repository is public and the token is the only thing guarding a loopback
# server that can drive the developer's browser.
.mcp.json
.codex/
